  <li style="margin-botton:5px">
  \name_enonce9 \(x_1\) \name_and \(x_2\) \name_in \(\mathcal{D}\).
  <br>\name_enonce8[1] \(x_1\) \name_and \(x_2\) \name_enonce8[2]:
  \x1 \name_and \x2.
